]ALB provides law firms with cutting[ edge][ legal] software which drives[ effic]iencies throughout a law[ firm] and provides a platform from which firms can grow and increase revenue in a competitive marketplace. ALB is the legal software[ of] choice for solicitors[ looking] to[ innovate] their practice, work smarter and[ become][ a][ market][ leader].
