Each fall, the Indiana Conservation Partnership (ICP)[ –] a coalition of eight Indiana agencies including the Indiana Association of Soil and Water Conservation[ District]s (IASWCD) – sponsors four District Showcase Awards throughout the state. The showcases allow[ Indiana]’s[ conservation][ districts] the chance to share best practices for conservation project design and implementation.
